  "summary": "Authorize the exact public-guide link repair exposed by CC-001.",
  "why": "Strict networked link checking found that the existing www.catb.org URL in PRINCIPLES.md fails TLS hostname validation. The maintained Art of Unix Programming page is available at the non-www host under the author's historic ~esr path. This revision adds only that guide to the delegated scope; suppressions, TLS weakening, and broad guide edits remain unauthorized."
